    {
      "id": "1fc5601375d49a99614e955bcb8aa121470e758f",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1221220249,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Ah, yes, this is a problem. I think that length is still not quite decremented correctly, though, even with this change, and that might result in extra REPLACMENT CHARACTERs at the end.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-12-26T19:25:59.781Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-12-26T19:25:59.781Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 196336997,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 9214,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "730371db4e90d18784fbb3a4bab0406812467ece",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1221227036,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I think in this case we still want to decrement `length` by the difference between `prev` and `ptr` (which is the number of bytes the partial sequence took up. Do the following, and then the extra test isn't necessary, we can just test the length.\n\n```\n        length -= (gint)(ptr - prev);\n        prev += valid_bytes;\n        if (ptr - prev) {\n            wmem_strbuf_append_unichar_repl(str);\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
